# moves into this repository, Q-0005.2, and the fork is frozen as the oracle). Imported by thrust issue #44.
#
# In the commit that adds this file, web/apps/web and web/packages are byte-identical to source_commit. The proof is a
# tree-hash comparison, which does not depend on the path:
#   git rev-parse <thrust commit>:web/apps/web   ==  source_tree_apps_web
#   git rev-parse <thrust commit>:web/packages   ==  source_tree_packages
# The files at the root of web/ (listed under source_root_files) are also copied as they are at source_commit; a later
# commit may adapt them (the lockfile is pruned to this workspace, and the husky hook is dropped), and says so.
#
# After the import, only the files that Q-R2 allows may change under web/apps/web and web/packages
# (the auth client, the base URL and service layer, the collab provider, branding). scripts/check-web-diff.sh enforces it,
# without the pin (which is not pushed), from two files beside this one: PIN-MANIFEST (the mode and blob hash of every
# file the pin has under apps/web and packages; it must rebuild the two tree hashes below) and ALLOWED-CHANGES (the files
# that may differ from it, and so the ledger of the departures).

